      "writtenOn": "2021-02-26T08:40:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When motion_sense_suspend(), the body detection is disabled, so this part will not be triggered in S3. If there is any case that we still need to disable this without motion_sense_suspend(), please correct me.",
      "parentUuid": "df4e0e03_ff747355",
      "revId": "d406eff72656fd7c81b04f64cc6160597bdfe6f5",
