      "writtenOn": "2021-03-02T20:56:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry, I was not on the right branch.\nSo yes, disabling body_detect at suspend as you wrote works.\nHowever, I feel we are abusing the WAKE_UP flag to force the activity event to the AP. Activity should not be under control of the fifo timeout so we need special handling to send a message as soon as possible.",
      "parentUuid": "d2ea4c9d_5ca31c7a",
      "revId": "d406eff72656fd7c81b04f64cc6160597bdfe6f5",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
